sequenceDiagram

actor Admin
participant Server as server.js
participant Route as routes/admin.js + guards + validation
participant C as controllers/providers.js
participant M as Provider / ProviderApplication
participant DB as MongoDB
Admin->>Server: POST /api/v1/admin/applications/{applicationId}/review
Server->>Route: Parsed JSON
Route->>C: Admin actor + validated decision and optional reason
activate C
C->>M: Preliminary application lookup for providerId
M->>DB: Read provider reference
C->>DB: Start transaction
C->>M: Increment provider revision guard
M->>DB: Lock provider
C->>M: Update application only if still pending
M->>DB: Record decision, reviewer, timestamp and rejection reason
alt No pending application matched
    C->>DB: Abort
    C-->>Server: next(AppError 409)
else Decision is approve
    C->>M: Set approvedApplicationId
    Note over C,M: Set approved status only if provider is not suspended
    M->>DB: Update provider in same session
    DB-->>C: Commit
    C-->>Server: 200 serialized application
else Decision is reject
    Note over C,M: Keep last approved profile, set rejected only without one and when not suspended
    C->>M: Update provider status if applicable
    M->>DB: Persist in same session
    DB-->>C: Commit
    C-->>Server: 200 serialized application
end
deactivate C
Server-->>Admin: JSON response
